{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43552","headline":"连句多暇赠陆三山人 · 耿湋","name":"连句多暇赠陆三山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一生爲墨客，几世作茶仙。\n喜是攀阑者，慙非负鼎贤。\n禁门闻曙漏，顾渚入晨烟。\n拜井孤城里，携笼万壑前。\n闲喧悲异趣，语默取同年。\n历落惊相偶，衰羸猥见怜。\n诗书闻讲诵，文雅接兰荃。\n未敢重芳席，焉能弄彩笺。\n黑池流研水，径石涩苔钱。\n何事亲香案，无端狎钓船。\n野中求逸礼，江上访遗编。\n莫发搜歌意，予心或不然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}